# Cursor Rules — Document Import Wizard

## Project context
This is a React + TypeScript conversion of a fully designed HTML prototype.
The prototype is at `src/doc_import_wizard_complete.html` — it is the visual source of truth.
Always open the prototype in a browser when building components to compare.

## Core rules
- Match the prototype layout exactly — spacing, colours, font sizes, border radii
- Use inline styles for all cluster/pill colours (hex values from data files)
- Do not use Tailwind colour names for semantic colours — use tokens.ts values
- TypeScript strict mode — no `any`, no `@ts-ignore`
- Zustand for all shared state — no prop drilling beyond 1 level
- Components should be small and focused — split if >150 lines

## Component conventions
- One component per file
- Props interfaces defined at top of file
- Default exports only for page-level components, named exports for shared components
- Use `clsx` or template literals for conditional classes — no ternary soup

## Styling conventions
- Tailwind for layout/spacing utilities only
- All colours from tokens.ts or data files — inline style
- Border radius: 8px (--r), 12px (--r2), 16px (--r3)
- Font sizes: 8px labels, 9px meta, 10px sub, 11px body, 12px default, 14px titles

## Data conventions
- Never hardcode cluster/process data in components — always import from src/data/
- Cluster order is user-controlled (drag) — read from clusterStore, not data file directly
- Diagram node positions are fixed pixel values — do not try to auto-layout

## Canvas / diagram rules
- Use react-zoom-pan-pinch for the transform wrapper
- SVG is rendered by hand from diagrams.ts data — no diagram library
- Minimap: copy SVG innerHTML into minimap div, scale with CSS transform
- Arrow routing: straight line if Δy < 10px, L-bend otherwise
- Arrow marker: grey `#b0b0b0`, 5×5, auto-orient

## What NOT to do
- Do not add features not in the prototype
- Do not change the 6-step wizard flow
- Do not add animations beyond what the prototype has (confidence bar width transition only)
- Do not use any UI component library (no shadcn, no MUI, no Radix beyond primitives)
- Do not add "Skip to generate" or any extra footer buttons
